message: "If these notes help your work, please cite them as below."
title: "ClearScan Engineering: field notes from building and running a production ATS resume scanner"
abstract: "Engineering notes on building an ATS resume scanner: architecture, scoring philosophy, anti-gaming principles, AI that does not invent facts, occupational data, and real production incidents. Includes a set of 26 synthetic resumes with ground truth and a first benchmark of PDF text extractors. The notes are CC BY 4.0; the research folder is CC0 (data) and MIT (code)."
